<p><strong>3D Model Viewer</strong></p>
<p>Render and inspect 3D model files (.stl, .obj, .gltf, .glb, .3mf) using Three.js with orbit camera controls, lighting, wireframe toggle, and folder navigation.</p>
<div style="margin-top: 0.8rem;">
    <p><strong>Mouse & Keyboard Navigation:</strong></p>
    <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 0.4rem; font-size: 0.85rem;">
        <thead>
            <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #30363d; text-align: left; color: #58a6ff;">
                <th style="padding: 4px;">Control</th>
                <th style="padding: 4px;">Action</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #21262d;">
                <td style="padding: 4px;">Left Click + Drag</td>
                <td style="padding: 4px;">Orbit / Rotate View</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #21262d;">
                <td style="padding: 4px;">Right Click + Drag</td>
                <td style="padding: 4px;">Pan Camera</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #21262d;">
                <td style="padding: 4px;">Scroll Wheel</td>
                <td style="padding: 4px;">Zoom In / Zoom Out</td>
